@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il27-tax-years`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Income Tax Ordinance s 46 — "תרומה למוסד ציבורי", the credit for a donation to a public institution. Row IL-27.
-- Source lines 1744-1751.
--
-- A person who donated in a tax year a sum exceeding the minimum (NIS 180 nominal, 207 for 2024-2027 by the consolidation's note) to a
-- national fund or to a public institution the Minister of Finance determined (with the Finance Committee's approval) is credited with
-- 35% of the donation, if an individual, and at the rate of s 126(a), if a body of persons; but no credit for the year is given for
-- donations above the lower of 30% of the taxable income and NIS 9,000,000 nominal (10,354,816 for 2024-2027 by the note) "the ceiling for
-- credit". A sum above the ceiling is credited, on the same terms, in the next three tax years in succession, in none of which may the
-- credit be for donations above the ceiling.
--
-- WHAT IS ENCODED. The credit for one tax year: the qualifying donations of the year, with the sums carried in from the three earlier years,
-- up to the ceiling, at the rate. The two amounts the section prints are inputs (`The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year`);
-- ito-il27-published-figures.l4 carries the consolidation's note for 2024-2027, an aid and not law. The institution being one the Minister
-- determined is a recorded determination: the caller lists only donations to such bodies. The body-of-persons rate is s 126(a)'s (23% in the
-- text retrieved; line 4 of s 126), taken as an input. s 46(a1), (a2), (d) (cancelling a determination) are the Minister's administrative
-- powers over an institution: inert for a computation (NOTES.md). The note on s 46B about commemorating a soldier (line 1758) is the
-- consolidation's summary of another Law (1962), which is not in the source bundle: out of scope.
--
-- FORK F7: the minimum. "תרם בשנת מס פלונית סכום העולה על 207" is read of the year's donations together, or of each donation. RULED by Meng on
-- 2026-10-08 (SHRUG): one named switch, default declined where the readings differ.
-- WHAT THE TEXT DOES NOT SAY (fork F16 in NOTES.md, answered only where it cannot matter): which donation the year's ceiling takes first, a carried sum or a
-- new one. The credit for the year does not depend on it (it is the lesser of everything available and the ceiling); only what remains, and
-- what lapses after three years, does. So the credit is answered, and what remains to carry forward is answered only where nothing can lapse.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Section 46 — donations`

-- src:1745 | (א) אדם שתרם בשנת מס פלונית סכום העולה על 180 שקלים חדשים [note: (נקוב לשנת 2012; בשנת 2023, 200 ש״ח; בשנים 2024–2027, 207 ש״ח)] לקרן לאומית, או למוסד ציבורי כמשמעותו בסעיף 9(2) שקבע לענין זה שר האוצר באישור ועדת הכספים של הכנסת, יזוכה מהמס שהוא חייב בו באותה שנה בשיעור של 35% מסכום התרומה – אם הוא יחיד, ובשיעור הקבוע בסעיף 126(א) מסכום התרומה – אם הוא חבר־בני־אדם, ובלבד שלא יינתן זיכוי בשנת מס פלונית בשל סכום כולל של תרומות העולה על 30% מההכנסה החייבת של הנישום באותה שנה או על 9,000,000 שקלים חדשים [note: (נקוב לשנת 2012; בשנת 2023, 10,019,808 ש״ח; בשנים 2024–2027, 10,354,816 ש״ח)], לפי הנמוך מביניהם (להלן – התקרה לזיכוי); סכום העולה על התקרה לזיכוי שנתרם באותה שנת מס, יזוכה מהמס בהתאם להוראות סעיף זה בשלוש שנות המס הבאות בזו אחר זו, ובלבד שלא יינתן זיכוי בכל אחת משלוש שנות המס כאמור, בשל סכום כולל של תרומות העולה על התקרה לזיכוי.
-- src:1746 | (א1) מוסד ציבורי כאמור בסעיף קטן (א) שלא הגיש שני דו״חות שנתיים ברציפות, או שמן הדו״חות שהגיש עולה כי אינו מנהל פנקסים כדין או שחלק מהותי מפעילותו אינו להשגת המטרה הציבורית, רשאי שר האוצר לבטל את קביעתו לענין סעיף קטן (א).
-- src:1747 | (א2) חידושה של קביעה שבוטלה לפי סעיף קטן (א1) טעון אישורה של ועדת הכספים של הכנסת.
-- src:1748 | (ב) [note: (בוטל).]
-- src:1749 | (ג) בסעיף זה, ”קרן לאומית“ – הסוכנות היהודית לא״י, ההסתדרות הציונית העולמית, המגבית המאוחדת לישראל והקרן הקיימת לישראל.
-- src:1750 | (ד)(1) נקבעו פנקסיו של מוסד ציבורי כבלתי קבילים קביעה שאינה ניתנת לערר או לערעור, רשאי המנהל לבטל את הקביעה שלפי סעיף קטן (א) מאותו יום ואילך.
-- src:1751 | (2) המוסד יודיע לציבור על ביטול כאמור, בדרך ובמועד שקבע המנהל.

@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745; fork F7
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 46(a) does not say whether the minimum donation applies to the donations of the year together or to each donation, and here the readings differ` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 46(a) does not say whether the minimum donation applies to the donations of the year together or to each donation, and here the readings differ"

@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 46(a) does not say which donations a year's ceiling takes first, and here the choice decides what lapses` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 46(a) does not say which donations a year's ceiling takes first, and here the choice decides what lapses"

@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745; fork F7; Meng's ruling of 2026-10-08 (SHRUG)
GIVETH A `A reading of "donated a sum exceeding" the minimum, in section 46(a)`
`section 46 — the reading row IL-27 takes of the minimum` MEANS
    `declined where the readings differ`

-- "סכום העולה על 207": strictly more than the minimum.
@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745; fork F7
GIVEN d IS A `A donor in a tax year, for section 46`
      a IS AN `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 46(a) — the year's donations that pass the minimum, read together, for` d `, at` a MEANS
    IF   sum (d's `donations in the tax year, each to a national fund or to an institution the Minister of Finance has determined`) GREATER THAN a's `the sum a donation must exceed`
    THEN sum (d's `donations in the tax year, each to a national fund or to an institution the Minister of Finance has determined`)
    ELSE 0

@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745; fork F7
GIVEN d IS A `A donor in a tax year, for section 46`
      a IS AN `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 46(a) — the year's donations that pass the minimum, each on its own, for` d `, at` a MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN x YIELD IF x GREATER THAN a's `the sum a donation must exceed` THEN x ELSE 0)
             (d's `donations in the tax year, each to a national fund or to an institution the Minister of Finance has determined`))

@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745; fork F7
GIVEN r IS A `A reading of "donated a sum exceeding" the minimum, in section 46(a)`
      a IS AN `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year`
      d IS A `A donor in a tax year, for section 46`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 46(a) — the donations of the year that count, reading the minimum as` r `, at` a `, for` d MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `the donations of the year together` THEN `together`
    WHEN `each donation on its own`           THEN `each`
    WHEN `declined where the readings differ` THEN
        IF   `together` EQUALS `each`
        THEN `together`
        ELSE `section 46(a) does not say whether the minimum donation applies to the donations of the year together or to each donation, and here the readings differ`
    WHERE
        `together` MEANS `s 46(a) — the year's donations that pass the minimum, read together, for` d `, at` a
        `each`     MEANS `s 46(a) — the year's donations that pass the minimum, each on its own, for` d `, at` a

-- The ceiling for credit: the lower of 30% of the taxable income and the absolute amount.
@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745 ("התקרה לזיכוי")
GIVEN a IS AN `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year`
      d IS A `A donor in a tax year, for section 46`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 46(a) — the ceiling for credit, at` a `, for` d MEANS
    min (30% TIMES d's `taxable income`) (a's `the absolute ceiling on donations credited in a tax year`)

-- The sums carried in from the three earlier tax years, together with the year's counting donations: what is available.
@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745 ("בשלוש שנות המס הבאות")
GIVEN d IS A `A donor in a tax year, for section 46`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 46(a) — the sums carried in, for` d MEANS
    d's `carried in`'s `from one tax year earlier` PLUS d's `carried in`'s `from two tax years earlier` PLUS d's `carried in`'s `from three tax years earlier`

@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745; fork F7
GIVEN r IS A `A reading of "donated a sum exceeding" the minimum, in section 46(a)`
      a IS AN `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year`
      d IS A `A donor in a tax year, for section 46`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 46(a) — the sums on which the credit is given, reading the minimum as` r `, at` a `, for` d MEANS
    min (`s 46(a) — the donations of the year that count, reading the minimum as` r `, at` a `, for` d PLUS `s 46(a) — the sums carried in, for` d)
        (`s 46(a) — the ceiling for credit, at` a `, for` d)

@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745 (35%; the rate of s 126(a) for a body of persons)
GIVEN d IS A `A donor in a tax year, for section 46`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 46(a) — the rate of the credit for` d MEANS
    IF   d's `an individual, and not a body of persons`
    THEN 35%
    ELSE d's `the rate fixed in section 126(a), for a body of persons`

@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745; fork F7
GIVEN r IS A `A reading of "donated a sum exceeding" the minimum, in section 46(a)`
      a IS AN `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year`
      d IS A `A donor in a tax year, for section 46`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the credit under section 46, reading the minimum as` r `, at` a `, for` d MEANS
    `for tax year` (d's `tax year`) `, row IL-27 answers`
        (`s 46(a) — the sums on which the credit is given, reading the minimum as` r `, at` a `, for` d TIMES `s 46(a) — the rate of the credit for` d)

@export The credit under Income Tax Ordinance s 46 (donations to a national fund or an approved public institution) for a tax year from 2024, in NIS: 35% (the s 126(a) rate for a body of persons) of the qualifying donations of the year and the sums carried in from the three earlier years, up to the lower of 30% of taxable income and the absolute ceiling; declines where the minimum donation reads differently for the year's donations together and each on its own
@ref ITO s 46(a), lines 1745-1751
GIVEN a IS AN `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year`
          @desc NIS; the minimum a donation must exceed and the absolute ceiling, as adjusted under s 120B for the tax year
      d IS A `A donor in a tax year, for section 46`
          @desc the tax year, whether an individual, the year's donations, the taxable income, the sums carried in, and the s 126(a) rate for a body of persons
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the credit under section 46 at` a `for` d MEANS
    `the credit under section 46, reading the minimum as` `section 46 — the reading row IL-27 takes of the minimum` `, at` a `, for` d

-- What remains after the year's credit: the available sums less those credited, for the next three tax years. Where a sum carried in from
-- three tax years earlier remains, whether it lapses depends on which sums the ceiling took first; declined there.
@ref ITO s 46(a), line 1745
GIVEN a IS AN `The amounts of section 46 in force in the tax year`
      d IS A `A donor in a tax year, for section 46`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the donations that remain to be carried forward from the tax year under section 46, at` a `, for` d MEANS
    `for tax year` (d's `tax year`) `, row IL-27 answers`
        (IF   `left over` EQUALS 0
         THEN 0
         ELSE IF   d's `carried in`'s `from three tax years earlier` GREATER THAN 0
              THEN `section 46(a) does not say which donations a year's ceiling takes first, and here the choice decides what lapses`
              ELSE `left over`)
    WHERE
        `counting`  MEANS `s 46(a) — the donations of the year that count, reading the minimum as` `section 46 — the reading row IL-27 takes of the minimum` `, at` a `, for` d
        `credited`  MEANS `s 46(a) — the sums on which the credit is given, reading the minimum as` `section 46 — the reading row IL-27 takes of the minimum` `, at` a `, for` d
        `left over` MEANS `counting` PLUS `s 46(a) — the sums carried in, for` d MINUS `credited`
